msgid "For the stm32 port, the ARM cross-compiler is required:"
msgstr "stm32 portu için ARM çapraz derleyicisi gereklidir:"

#: ../../develop/gettingstarted.rst:105
msgid ""
"See the `ARM GCC toolchain <https://developer.arm.com/downloads/-/arm-gnu-"
